{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TtqHQq5afoLbyEWXjGX5UQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:56.190381+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TtqHQq5afoLbyEWXjGX5UQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZkKibVUkDOiaqDJq0NNVcnia1ByN2auSSf2jmiccaiaYhmTXg1WxSBiaqWnz4V0P4ia9QgzKxDFOicq8PphohQ66fQt6Tg1R9NAgqDHbpTxeRysjutU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZkKibVUkDOiaqDJq0NNVcnia1ByN2auSSf2jmiccaiaYhmTXg1WxSBiaqWnz4V0P4ia9QgzKxDFOicq8PphohQ66fQt6Tg1R9NAgqDHbpTxeRysjutU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icvzw1NfII0T0ibJvTVOG1xmLjTxXh0zvTBrxl8WwGQAVXejvjibJymL6Px3bEm9tFUlJFwx4nIiarYZa6Et71CQ28Ae75LuxXXJAmL5ptlEZdE/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLy42tnIt1MTMZsayj0HvH0vmr9Y8iaRMiakzUcVboyfEsvLyCWHx7nVDWM0tooyXZUM6Y5bPbpuCh5Oy2hOV63QiaaC6NDYUKGgo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>主题背景</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLdjNfYRVrWBR0tCfg540NwAKbBj5DibGq2pW0NyKbzUIOdWhPQ7fE9dibicJ1J1FzkRWTz6oSVjvPpzwmE6nA6gbpprmNCibFu65U/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/icvzw1NfII0R2MLV9zb2oOwgDsocKo5e6JGibncGiajF9uiaCzThy1UfMszBibU0I5gEUtSgKhUoBc7gYtgrzNZgahsGSrBsoiaaJjKTQcILzp7tE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>当数字孪生赋能空间创作，城市大脑、CIM时空底座与生态人居双向赋能，数字化浪潮下的未来城市将如何演进？不同专业的你，构想中的数智城市人居是什么模样？</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>生成式 AI、实景三维、低空智能、城市大数据等技术持续重塑城市空间结构、建筑设计范式与全域生态系统，驱动城市规划、建造、治理全链条数字化革新。活动覆盖地理信息与智慧城市、测绘工程、CityX、城乡规划、建筑、风景园林六大方向，围绕 AI 数智设计、数字孪生仿真、湾区智慧更新、韧性低碳城市、时空大数据空间决策等前沿议题展开深度探索。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLy42tnIt1MTMZsayj0HvH0vmr9Y8iaRMiakzUcVboyfEsvLyCWHx7nVDWM0tooyXZUM6Y5bPbpuCh5Oy2hOV63QiaaC6NDYUKGgo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动目的</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLdjNfYRVrWBR0tCfg540NwAKbBj5DibGq2pW0NyKbzUIOdWhPQ7fE9dibicJ1J1FzkRWTz6oSVjvPpzwmE6nA6gbpprmNCibFu65U/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为促进跨专业学术交流，夯实空间领域多学科交叉创新能力，增进全国高校学子对深圳大学建规学院研究生培养体系、数智科研平台的全面认知，近距离感受湾区前沿学术氛围与特色育人模式，深圳大学建筑与城市规划学院特面向全国优秀本科生举办2026“智慧城市与数智设计”暑期夏令营。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/icvzw1NfII0RUkhbPmiatGp2FPMFBsk9ibEmjhK8aUqSvhQsd9KzAAshNVpszxhgodgS1jKHwcJJqhoINLvZ4Ts68KIquv8vfI2Ciccf2Eu8YcA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>本次活动面向地理信息与智慧城市、测绘工程、CityX、城乡规划、建筑学、风景园林相关专业学子，搭建测绘、空间信息、设计、智能技术深度融合的跨界学术交流平台。学院联动深圳本地科创企业与一线智慧城市项目资源，汇聚全国青年设计与空间科研人才，共探数智技术重塑城市人居的前沿理论与实践路径。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLy42tnIt1MTMZsayj0HvH0vmr9Y8iaRMiakzUcVboyfEsvLyCWHx7nVDWM0tooyXZUM6Y5bPbpuCh5Oy2hOV63QiaaC6NDYUKGgo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLdjNfYRVrWBR0tCfg540NwAKbBj5DibGq2pW0NyKbzUIOdWhPQ7fE9dibicJ1J1FzkRWTz6oSVjvPpzwmE6nA6gbpprmNCibFu65U/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>暑期学校计划招收不多于100人。学员可通过网上申请报名，具体申请条件：（1）就读于具有硕士推免权的普通高校，地理信息与智慧城市、测绘工程、CityX、城乡规划、建筑、风景园林相关专业的优秀应届生；（2）四/五年综合绩点排名前20%，或创新能力突出。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLy42tnIt1MTMZsayj0HvH0vmr9Y8iaRMiakzUcVboyfEsvLyCWHx7nVDWM0tooyXZUM6Y5bPbpuCh5Oy2hOV63QiaaC6NDYUKGgo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLdjNfYRVrWBR0tCfg540NwAKbBj5DibGq2pW0NyKbzUIOdWhPQ7fE9dibicJ1J1FzkRWTz6oSVjvPpzwmE6nA6gbpprmNCibFu65U/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）个人简历；</span></p><p><span>（2）作品集（建筑/规划/风景园林专业提供，5个作品左右，50M以内），请按照“2026暑期学校+姓名”邮件命名，发送至elantriss@163.com；</span></p><p><span>（3）其它能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、学术论文首页、四六级成绩证明、本科在校成绩单等）。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLy42tnIt1MTMZsayj0HvH0vmr9Y8iaRMiakzUcVboyfEsvLyCWHx7nVDWM0tooyXZUM6Y5bPbpuCh5Oy2hOV63QiaaC6NDYUKGgo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLdjNfYRVrWBR0tCfg540NwAKbBj5DibGq2pW0NyKbzUIOdWhPQ7fE9dibicJ1J1FzkRWTz6oSVjvPpzwmE6nA6gbpprmNCibFu65U/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 该系统在7月4日前仅限暑期学校报名，7月5日后开放推免生预报名。</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）报名时间:即日起至2026年7月4日</span></p><p><span>（2）报名入口：（建议电脑端谷歌浏览器）http://ehall.szu.edu.cn/yz/ybm</span></p><p><span>（3）材料审核：审核通过名单将在报名系统上公布，并通知申请者本人。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLy42tnIt1MTMZsayj0HvH0vmr9Y8iaRMiakzUcVboyfEsvLyCWHx7nVDWM0tooyXZUM6Y5bPbpuCh5Oy2hOV63QiaaC6NDYUKGgo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLdjNfYRVrWBR0tCfg540NwAKbBj5DibGq2pW0NyKbzUIOdWhPQ7fE9dibicJ1J1FzkRWTz6oSVjvPpzwmE6nA6gbpprmNCibFu65U/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）活动日期：2025年7月10号至7月12日（该日程为计划日程，以实际通知为准）</span></p><p><span>（2）活动安排：</span></p></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><span>7.10</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span> 报到破冰，开启跨界社交</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7.11</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span> 开幕式+专家讲座+专业方向解析+分专业活动</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>7.12</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span> 分专业工作坊（建筑设计/空间规划/风景园林/数据建模）+结营表彰</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLy42tnIt1MTMZsayj0HvH0vmr9Y8iaRMiakzUcVboyfEsvLyCWHx7nVDWM0tooyXZUM6Y5bPbpuCh5Oy2hOV63QiaaC6NDYUKGgo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLdjNfYRVrWBR0tCfg540NwAKbBj5DibGq2pW0NyKbzUIOdWhPQ7fE9dibicJ1J1FzkRWTz6oSVjvPpzwmE6nA6gbpprmNCibFu65U/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）暑期学校结束后，将评选优秀营员等奖项，并颁发证书；</span></p><p><span>（2）入选暑期学校的外地外校学员，往返交通费自理，举办方统一安排校园周边酒店住宿（双人间）</span></p><p><span>（3）</span><span><span>联系人：于老师    </span></span><span><span>联系电话：0755-26536246</span></span></p><p><span>  邮箱：saup_fjylx@126.com</span></p><p><span>  地址：深圳市南山区深圳大学建筑与城市规划学院</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLy42tnIt1MTMZsayj0HvH0vmr9Y8iaRMiakzUcVboyfEsvLyCWHx7nVDWM0tooyXZUM6Y5bPbpuCh5Oy2hOV63QiaaC6NDYUKGgo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ARa08UR2jFLdjNfYRVrWBR0tCfg540NwAKbBj5DibGq2pW0NyKbzUIOdWhPQ7fE9dibicJ1J1FzkRWTz6oSVjvPpzwmE6nA6gbpprmNCibFu65U/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>深圳大学建筑与城市规划学院源自于1983年9月成立的深圳大学建筑系。经过42年发展，学院已成为国内具有较强影响力的建筑院校。学院现下设建筑系、城市规划系、风景园林系、城市空间信息工程系，并已建立了从本科到博士后流动站完整的人才培养体系。学院建筑学和城乡规划专业同时入选教育部“双万计划”国家一流专业建设点，并以优秀等级通过专业本科和硕士研究生教育评估。建筑学专业是广东省优势重点学科、名牌专业、重点专业建设点、教育部特色专业建设点。2024“软科中国最好学科”建筑学排名全国第7；城乡规划学专业排名全国第4。地理空间信息工程（智慧城市）专业为教育部特设专业，专业建设获得广东省教育教学成果特等奖。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icvzw1NfII0QUibPpHMz1CowQLgfVKzlBX0xzg9qdibLyP0OWke2IiajWrbK0sCfj2GUXOLA0wvIzEt9bJvuBibuT5pJmwfdxmq0hrrImCUufnEo/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>近年来，依托亚热带建筑与城市科学全国重点实验室、自然资源部大湾区地理环境监测重点实验室、国土空间大数据工程技术创新中心、自然资源部国土空间监测与仿真重点实验室、广东省城市空间信息工程重点实验室、人工智能与数字经济广东省实验室（深圳）、粤港澳智慧城市联合实验室、深圳市空间信息智能感知与服务重点实验室、建成环境优化设计研究重点实验室等部、省、市级科研平台。学院各专业承担了国家重点研发计划项目/课题、中国工程院咨询项目、国家自然科学基金重大项目（课题）和重点项目、国家自然科学基金面上与青年基金等科研课题100余项。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icvzw1NfII0Qf1OZGy0SmQ96wqpQf38CwaFTTdWw8XHqAgiciaxAk26TQph3C8l95suNhIhHFmgtgibuykXov3yA5KuNBDPugIkQKUXqTgfL40M/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>供 稿 人 ：</span><span>陶伊奇、</span><span><span>任青云</span></span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>微信编辑：曾心儒、冯经雅</span></span></p><p><span><span>微信初审：</span><span><span>张轶伟</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>微信复审：齐   奕</span></span></p><p><span><span>微信终审：钟波涛</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icvzw1NfII0SWciaojju1E4Ur8kceg42Xg9yrJqTuQxG2Uetu9ICTdDhbicprTzXIUlMEasOQoc97liaWm3DfDBpu2SicQReicrvXYuVtibvbaFhjE/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"0e2c499dd102f33beb6aff5585dacfbad33f5ea3becd9dcdc602e39654f30dc3","textLength":1814,"sourceSha256":"d4a3efdb7d337cdd11ceb5a4b6c9df4be62f67e326b5d6b9a52e115bfd5f07d5","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-dfe8bb369ec9a4ad1f96","title":"2026年深圳大学建筑与城市规划学院2026“智慧城市与数智设计”暑期夏令营招募开启","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:56.190381+00:00"}
